    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/308da1a11a21a3e3e80a53cb6fbc87bb.avif?t=1744712930\" width=350 height=103 /></span><br>Step into the mystical world of <strong>Durga</strong>, a fearless <strong>teenager village girl</strong> on a journey of survival, discovery, and destiny. Set deep within the <strong>Indian forests</strong>, this <strong>story-driven RPG</strong> takes you on an emotional and adventurous quest, where ancient mythology meets real-life struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/b635cc2e960dfd6d0e916a5eef1e0cbd.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Unlock Chapters of the Past</strong> \u2013 Progress through <strong>one-by-one chapters</strong>, each revealing deeper connections to India\u2019s <strong>mythological heritage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Brave the Wild</strong> \u2013 Face <strong>lions and other wild animals</strong>, gather resources, and adapt to the untamed wilderness. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd38 <strong>Solve Mystical Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Find <strong>hidden objects</strong>, interact with villagers, and piece together the <strong>forgotten Puranic stories</strong>.<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Discover Her Legacy</strong> \u2013 Witness Durga\u2019s transformation from a brave girl to a <strong>guardian of rituals and ancient wisdom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81 <strong>Will you guide Durga to embrace her fate and revive the lost ancient tales?</strong> The journey begins now! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/58e3fb1d113818a18cd2fd28ab5e37ca.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the latest updates on Durga\u2019s journey! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/308da1a11a21a3e3e80a53cb6fbc87bb.avif?t=1744712930\" width=350 height=103 /></span><br>Step into the mystical world of <strong>Durga</strong>, a fearless <strong>teenager village girl</strong> on a journey of survival, discovery, and destiny. Set deep within the <strong>Indian forests</strong>, this <strong>story-driven RPG</strong> takes you on an emotional and adventurous quest, where ancient mythology meets real-life struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/47379d5dac8d14655466458467c5fbb0.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/b635cc2e960dfd6d0e916a5eef1e0cbd.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Unlock Chapters of the Past</strong> \u2013 Progress through <strong>one-by-one chapters</strong>, each revealing deeper connections to India\u2019s <strong>mythological heritage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Brave the Wild</strong> \u2013 Face <strong>lions and other wild animals</strong>, gather resources, and adapt to the untamed wilderness. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/2b152ff2f741641c27c1a9633749fa0b.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd38 <strong>Solve Mystical Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Find <strong>hidden objects</strong>, interact with villagers, and piece together the <strong>forgotten Puranic stories</strong>.<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Discover Her Legacy</strong> \u2013 Witness Durga\u2019s transformation from a brave girl to a <strong>guardian of rituals and ancient wisdom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.poster.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.webm?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/ed3bf57ce5fb2c427dda53541664e63a.mp4?t=1744712930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd81 <strong>Will you guide Durga to embrace her fate and revive the lost ancient tales?</strong> The journey begins now! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/58e3fb1d113818a18cd2fd28ab5e37ca.avif?t=1744712930\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the latest updates on Durga\u2019s journey! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
